{ rad_mcp's photometric correction file (Phase 11a, ruling R469).
  Derived from Radiance 6.1a's lib/source.cal (the stock file):
  stock lines 28-29 and 43, which comment out the five correction formulas, and lines 45-49, which
  redefine them through the compiled source_corr(), are removed. On this build source_corr drops the
  brightdata A1 multiplier: ERCO at 2 m reads 0.168 lux stock and 175.061 lux with this file.
